<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 11.8% in week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 11.8% in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said its UK weekly department store sales rose 11.8 percent in the week to June 7 from the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the 19 weeks to June 7, sales were up 9.3 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, rose 5.7 percent in the latest week and 6.9 percent in the 19-week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
